Third-party and source provenance

CARLA is an external simulator dependency. No CARLA binaries, maps, LibCarla source,
or Unreal Engine source are included. The VLM snapshots are synthetic CARLA renders.
The locally archived CARLA MIT license is preserved in docs/CARLA_LICENSE.txt for
attribution and review; it is not a license grant for all materials in this package.

CTG/MPC/LQR sources and the Python runtime are copied or extracted from the project's
V3 runtime source snapshot. Their file hashes and public adaptations are recorded
in reproducibility/artifact_provenance.json. No existing source copyright or license
notice has been removed. Original project-code licensing requires owner review.

NumPy, pandas, matplotlib, Pillow, tabulate, PyYAML, PyTorch and CARLA Python API are
dependencies installed separately and retain their own licenses. Their code or
pretrained third-party weights are not vendored here.

OpenAI model identifier gpt-5.2 appears in the archived VLM research artifact. No
model weights, account credentials or API access are distributed.
